  m_text: "<b>I. M\u1EE5c ti\xEAu</b>\r\n1. H\u1ECDc sinh nh\u1EADn di\u1EC7n m\u1ED9t
    s\u1ED1 lo\xE0i c\xF4n tr\xF9ng nguy hi\u1EC3m v\xE0 h\u1EADu qu\u1EA3 khi b\u1ECB
    \u0111\u1ED1t.\r\n2. H\u1ECDc sinh bi\u1EBFt c\xE1ch x\u1EED l\xFD \u0111\xFAng
    khi b\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED1t.\r\n3. H\u1ECDc sinh \xE1p d\u1EE5ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    c\xE1c c\xE1ch ph\xF2ng tr\xE1nh c\xF4n tr\xF9ng \u0111\u1ED1t.\r\n\r\n<b>II.
    Chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB tr\u01B0\u1EDBc bu\u1ED5i h\u1ECDc</b>\r\n- Gi\xE1o vi\xEAn:
    Ph\u1EA7n m\u1EC1m K\u0129 n\u0103ng s\u1ED1ng Novastars, b\u1ED9 th\u1EBB \u0111\xE1p
    \xE1n 1234.\r\n- H\u1ECDc sinh: Gi\u1EA5y b\xFAt."
